    "Gzip remains default with unchanged gzip decoder semantics and inclusive numerical limits. XZ pins FORMAT_XZ/CRC64/preset6 and rejects corrupt, truncated, trailing, concatenated, wrong-check, excessive-dictionary and raw-bomb streams with fixed memory and output bounds. Declared codec alone selects decoding.",
